# OKF validation

The deterministic strict checker receives a temporary bundle with this
`.okf` journal projected verbatim to `acceptance.md` because its file walker
only checks `.md` concepts. Evidence companions are copied alongside it so
links resolve. The log is [okf-validation.txt](okf-validation.txt). The coordinated parent validation also removed the nested index's root-only
frontmatter; all three concept files now pass the whole-parent strict checker.
